   "Summarise the orders in data/orders-2026-07.csv into out/summary-2026-07.json (JSON: month, orders, units, revenue, byRegion, topProduct; amounts are quantity × unit_price × (1 − discount), rounded to cents). Check it with `node --test checks/summary-2026-07.test.mjs` and present it.",
   "Write the region table of data/orders-2026-08.csv to out/regions-2026-08.csv (CSV with region, orders and revenue per region, sorted by region; revenue is quantity × unit_price × (1 − discount), rounded to cents). Check it with `node --test checks/regions-2026-08.test.mjs` and present it.",
   "Write the region table of data/orders-2026-09.csv to out/regions-2026-09.csv (CSV with region, orders and revenue per region, sorted by region; revenue is quantity × unit_price × (1 − discount), rounded to cents). Check it with `node --test checks/regions-2026-09.test.mjs` and present it.",
   "Write the region table of data/orders-2026-10.csv to out/regions-2026-10.csv (CSV with region, orders and revenue per region, sorted by region; revenue is quantity × unit_price × (1 − discount), rounded to cents). Check it with `node --test checks/regions-2026-10.test.mjs` and present it.",
   "Write the region table of data/orders-2026-11.csv to out/regions-2026-11.csv (CSV with region, orders and revenue per region, sorted by region; revenue is quantity × unit_price × (1 − discount), rounded to cents). Check it with `node --test checks/regions-2026-11.test.mjs` and present it."
  ],
  "comments": [
   "格式很清楚，谢谢。",
   "地区表少了一列：每个地区的平均客单价（总收入除以订单数，保留两位小数）。",
   "我们的地区表一直都要带平均客单价那一列，这次又没有。",
   "数字对上了。",
   "还是缺 avg_order_value，以后每个月的地区表都要有这一列。",
   "地区表还要一列收入占比：每个地区收入占当月总收入的百分比，保留一位小数。",
   "收入占比那一列还是没有，我们每个月都要看这个。",
   "请以后的地区表都加上 revenue_share 列（百分比，一位小数）。"
  ]
